an class="ssrcss-uddlo-LinkTextContainer e16sf9dy0">Puzzles &amp; Quizzes</span></a></li><li class="ssrcss-114cmmm-StyledMenuItem e16sf9dy2"><a href="/cbeebies/watch" aria-label="Watch &amp; Sing" class="ssrcss-1st84u5-StyledLink e16sf9dy1"><span data-testid="watch" class="ssrcss-8l7b05-StyledImageContainer e1tgpf240"></span><span class="ssrcss-uddlo-LinkTextContainer e16sf9dy0">Watch &amp; Sing</span></a></li><li class="ssrcss-114cmmm-StyledMenuItem e16sf9dy2"><a href="/cbeebies/joinin" aria-label="Join In" class="ssrcss-gvrbvm-StyledLink e16sf9dy1"><span data-testid="joinin" class="ssrcss-a5nzdw-StyledImageContainer e1tgpf240"></span><span class="ssrcss-uddlo-LinkTextContainer e16sf9dy0">Join In</span></a></li><li class="ssrcss-114cmmm-StyledMenuItem e16sf9dy2"><a href="/cbeebies/makes" aria-label="Make &amp; Colour" class="ssrcss-1ekbqma-StyledLink e16sf9dy1"><span data-testid="makes" class="ssrcss-10q3wx9-StyledImageContainer e1tgpf240"></span><span class="ssrcss-uddlo-LinkTextContainer e16sf9dy0">Make &amp; Colour</span></a></li><li class="ssrcss-114cmmm-StyledMenuItem e16sf9dy2"><a href="/cbeebies/radio" aria-label="Radio" class="ssrcss-1pcczc5-StyledLink e16sf9dy1"><span data-testid="radio" class="ssrcss-zmp6n5-StyledImageContainer e1tgpf240"></span><span class="ssrcss-uddlo-LinkTextContainer e16sf9dy0">Radio</span></a></li><li class="ssrcss-114cmmm-StyledMenuItem e16sf9dy2"><a href="/cbeebies/parenting" aria-label="Parenting" class="ssrcss-b9faa6-StyledLink e16sf9dy1"><span data-testid="parenting" class="ssrcss-1ea2uxs-StyledImageContainer e1tgpf240"></span><span class="ssrcss-uddlo-LinkTextContainer e16sf9dy0">Parenting</span></a></li></ul></div></div></nav></header></div><div class="ssrcss-yt1kbx-Wrap e42f8511"><div width="300" class="ssrcss-js09yk-ContainerWithSidebarWrapper e1jl38b40"><div class="ssrcss-1jea2tf-StyledZone e1mcntqj3"><main id="main-content" data-testid="main-content"><article class="ssrcss-bto9mt-ArticleWrapper e1nh2i2l0"><div spacing="6" class="ssrcss-15twdc6-Stack e1y4nx260"><div data-block="childrensHeader" class="ssrcss-l7emlr-ComponentWrapper e1aon0op1"><div class="ssrcss-usmnse-Spacer e1aon0op0"><header data-testid="childrens-header"><h1 id="main-heading" type="headline" tabindex="-1" class="ssrcss-xqo5l9-Heading e10rt3ze0">Seven techniques for helping kids keep calm</h1></header></div></div><div data-block="text" class="ssrcss-vxwoax-ComponentWrapper e1aon0op1"><div class="ssrcss-126h8e-Spacer e1aon0op0"><div data-testid="rich-text"><div class="ssrcss-nqezkk-RichTextContainer e5tfeyi1"><p class="ssrcss-1q0x1qg-Paragraph e1jhz7w10">Try these simple relaxation and mindfulness activities together and help your child learn to calm down when they feel stressed or anxious.</p></div></div></div></div><div data-block="image" class="ssrcss-l7emlr-ComponentWrapper e1aon0op1"><div class="ssrcss-126h8e-Spacer e1aon0op0"><div data-testid="image" class="ssrcss-1uy5kw5-FullWidthWrapper ep2nwvo1"><figure class="ssrcss-zv4k6i-StyledFigure e34k3c22"><div class="ssrcss-ab5fd8-StyledFigureContainer e34k3c21"><span class="ssrcss-1pflr6j-Placeholder etlorgc0"><picture><source srcSet="https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/240/childrens/childrens-binarystore/cbeebies/relaxation_for_kids_article_content_card.jpg.webp 240w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/320/childrens/childrens-binarystore/cbeebies/relaxation_for_kids_article_content_card.jpg.webp 320w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/480/childrens/childrens-binarystore/cbeebies/relaxation_for_kids_article_content_card.jpg.webp 480w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/624/childrens/childrens-binarystore/cbeebies/relaxation_for_kids_article_content_card.jpg.webp 624w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/800/childrens/childrens-binarystore/cbeebies/relaxation_for_kids_article_content_card.jpg.webp 800w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/976/childrens/childrens-binarystore/cbeebies/relaxation_for_kids_article_content_card.jpg.webp 976w" type="image/webp"/><img alt="A young boy lying on the grass with his eyes closed looking happy." loading="lazy" src="https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/976/childrens/childrens-binarystore/cbeebies/relaxation_for_kids_article_content_card.jpg" srcSet="https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/240/childrens/childrens-binarystore/cbeebies/relaxation_for_kids_article_content_card.jpg 240w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/320/childrens/childrens-binarystore/cbeebies/relaxation_for_kids_article_content_card.jpg 320w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/480/childrens/childrens-binarystore/cbeebies/relaxation_for_kids_article_content_card.jpg 480w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/624/childrens/childrens-binarystore/cbeebies/relaxation_for_kids_article_content_card.jpg 624w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/800/childrens/childrens-binarystore/cbeebies/relaxation_for_kids_article_content_card.jpg 800w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/976/childrens/childrens-binarystore/cbeebies/relaxation_for_kids_article_content_card.jpg 976w" width="976" height="549" class="ssrcss-egie1y-Image edrdn950"/></picture></span></div></figure></div></div></div><div data-block="text" class="ssrcss-vxwoax-ComponentWrapper e1aon0op1"><div class="ssrcss-126h8e-Spacer e1aon0op0"><div data-testid="rich-text"><div class="ssrcss-nqezkk-RichTextContainer e5tfeyi1"><p class="ssrcss-1q0x1qg-Paragraph e1jhz7w10">Even very young children can feel stressed and anxious, especially during times of change or upheaval. Luckily, there are lots of simple activities you can do together to help your little one learn to calm themselves.</p><p class="ssrcss-1q0x1qg-Paragraph e1jhz7w10">Being able to recognise and cope with anxiety is a skill that will benefit children for life - try these simple, calming activities together and see which ones work for you.</p></div></div></div></div><div data-block="subheadline" class="ssrcss-vxwoax-ComponentWrapper e1aon0op1"><div class="ssrcss-usmnse-Spacer e1aon0op0"><div data-testid="subheadline"><h2 id="1-Use-your-mind" tabindex="-1" class="ssrcss-1x50o22-Heading e10rt3ze0"><span role="text">1. Use your mind…</span></h2></div></div></div><div data-block="media" class="ssrcss-l7emlr-ComponentWrapper e1aon0op1"><div class="ssrcss-126h8e-Spacer e1aon0op0"><div class="ssrcss-1uy5kw5-FullWidthWrapper ep2nwvo1"><figure class="ssrcss-zv4k6i-StyledFigure e34k3c22"><div class="ssrcss-ab5fd8-StyledFigureContainer e34k3c21"><div data-chromatic="ignore" class="ssrcss-dtyrnv-MediaPlayerWrapper e1h75hkw2"><div data-testid="media-player-container-landscape" class="ssrcss-78d3mz-MediaContainer e1h75hkw1"><div class="ssrcss-199fzb3-MediaInner e1h75hkw0"><div data-testid="bbc-logo-wrapper" class="ssrcss-1tlcek-LogoIconWrapper eaj4kwa0"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 112 32" class="ssrcss-xi5oyi-StyledIcon e161cein1" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M112 0v32H80V0zM72 0v32H40V0zM32 0v32H0V0zm65.47 6.8q-2.16 0-3.9.65a8 8 0 0 0-4.9 4.75 10 10 0 0 0-.65 3.79q0 2.15.63 3.86a8 8 0 0 0 1.83 2.9q1.2 1.19 2.92 1.81 1.73.63 3.9.63 1.61 0 3.1-.36 1.46-.35 2.58-.97v-3.43a9.6 9.6 0 0 1-5.15 1.46 6.5 6.5 0 0 1-3.12-.7 4.6 4.6 0 0 1-1.95-2 7 7 0 0 1-.68-3.2q0-1.87.7-3.19a4.7 4.7 0 0 1 2-2 7 7 0 0 1 3.17-.69q1.35 0 2.57.36a8 8 0 0 1 2.26 1.05v-3.5q-1.14-.6-2.48-.9-1.33-.3-2.83-.31M55.76 7H49v18h7.17a10 10 0 0 0 3.65-.63 4.7 4.7 0 0 0 3.16-4.56q0-1.63-.85-2.78a5 5 0 0 0-2.43-1.67 4 4 0 0 0 1.73-1.5q.6-.94.6-2.23a4 4 0 0 0-1.65-3.43Q58.74 7 55.76 7m-40 0H9v18h7.17a10 10 0 0 0 3.65-.63 4.7 4.7 0 0 0 3.16-4.56q0-1.63-.85-2.78a5 5 0 0 0-2.43-1.67 4 4 0 0 0 1.73-1.5q.6-.94.6-2.23a4 4 0 0 0-1.65-3.43Q18.74 7 15.76 7m40.12 10.22q3.35 0 3.35 2.47 0 1.16-.88 1.77t-2.52.62h-3.18v-4.86Zm-40 0q3.35 0 3.35 2.47 0 1.16-.88 1.77t-2.52.62h-3.18v-4.86Zm39.53-7.3q2.91 0 2.92 2.14 0 1.1-.75 1.72-.75.63-2.17.62h-2.76V9.92Zm-40 0q2.91 0 2.92 2.14 0 1.1-.75 1.72-.75.63-2.17.62h-2.76V9.92Z"></path></svg></div></div></div><noscript><div class="ssrcss-7t07h9-ErrorMessage eitf6465"><div class="ssrcss-h7lv7m-StyledInnerContainer eitf6464"><div class="ssrcss-nbxsk2-TextContent eitf6461"><h2 type="normal" class="ssrcss-3nbqz0-Heading e10rt3ze0">To play this video you need to enable JavaScript in your browser.</h2><p class="ssrcss-1q0x1qg-Paragraph e1jhz7w10">This video can not be played</p></div></div></div></noscript></div></div></figure></div></div></div><div data-block="text" class="ssrcss-vxwoax-ComponentWrapper e1aon0op1"><div class="ssrcss-126h8e-Spacer e1aon0op0"><div data-testid="rich-text"><div class="ssrcss-nqezkk-RichTextContainer e5tfeyi1"><p class="ssrcss-1q0x1qg-Paragraph e1jhz7w10"><b class="ssrcss-1xjjfut-BoldText e5tfeyi3">Try it together</b></p><p class="ssrcss-1q0x1qg-Paragraph e1jhz7w10">Take a small food item (like a raisin or cracker) and ask your child to examine theirs closely (look at it, smell it, see what it feels like in their mouth, taste it and listen carefully to the sound it makes) as though they&#x27;ve never eaten one before.</p><p class="ssrcss-1q0x1qg-Paragraph e1jhz7w10"><b class="ssrcss-1xjjfut-BoldText e5tfeyi3">How it works</b></p><p class="ssrcss-1q0x1qg-Paragraph e1jhz7w10">Mindfulness is about being ‘in the moment’ and focusing completely on what you’re currently doing - using all your senses to really experience it. That might sound challenging for little ones, but simple mindfulness exercises can be a great way to help children learn to pause and think before reacting.</p></div></div></div></div><div data-block="subheadline" class="ssrcss-vxwoax-ComponentWrapper e1aon0op1"><div class="ssrcss-usmnse-Spacer e1aon0op0"><div data-testid="subheadline"><h2 id="2-Have-a-giggle-and-a-laugh" tabindex="-1" class="ssrcss-1x50o22-Heading e10rt3ze0"><span role="text">2. Have a giggle and a laugh</span></h2></div></div></div><div data-block="media" class="ssrcss-l7emlr-ComponentWrapper e1aon0op1"><div class="ssrcss-126h8e-Spacer e1aon0op0"><div class="ssrcss-1uy5kw5-FullWidthWrapper ep2nwvo1"><figure class="ssrcss-zv4k6i-StyledFigure e34k3c22"><div class="ssrcss-ab5fd8-StyledFigureContainer e34k3c21"><div data-chromatic="ignore" class="ssrcss-dtyrnv-MediaPlayerWrapper e1h75hkw2"><div data-testid="media-player-container-landscape" class="ssrcss-78d3mz-MediaContainer e1h75hkw1"><div class="ssrcss-199fzb3-MediaInner e1h75hkw0"><div data-testid="bbc-logo-wrapper" class="ssrcss-1tlcek-LogoIconWrapper eaj4kwa0"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 112 32" class="ssrcss-xi5oyi-StyledIcon e161cein1" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M112 0v32H80V0zM72 0v32H40V0zM32 0v32H0V0zm65.47 6.8q-2.16 0-3.9.65a8 8 0 0 0-4.9 4.75 10 10 0 0 0-.65 3.79q0 2.15.63 3.86a8 8 0 0 0 1.83 2.9q1.2 1.19 2.92 1.81 1.73.63 3.9.63 1.61 0 3.1-.36 1.46-.35 2.58-.97v-3.43a9.6 9.6 0 0 1-5.15 1.46 6.5 6.5 0 0 1-3.12-.7 4.6 4.6 0 0 1-1.95-2 7 7 0 0 1-.68-3.2q0-1.87.7-3.19a4.7 4.7 0 0 1 2-2 7 7 0 0 1 3.17-.69q1.35 0 2.57.36a8 8 0 0 1 2.26 1.05v-3.5q-1.14-.6-2.48-.9-1.33-.3-2.83-.31M55.76 7H49v18h7.17a10 10 0 0 0 3.65-.63 4.7 4.7 0 0 0 3.16-4.56q0-1.63-.85-2.78a5 5 0 0 0-2.43-1.67 4 4 0 0 0 1.73-1.5q.6-.94.6-2.23a4 4 0 0 0-1.65-3.43Q58.74 7 55.76 7m-40 0H9v18h7.17a10 10 0 0 0 3.65-.63 4.7 4.7 0 0 0 3.16-4.56q0-1.63-.85-2.78a5 5 0 0 0-2.43-1.67 4 4 0 0 0 1.73-1.5q.6-.94.6-2.23a4 4 0 0 0-1.65-3.43Q18.74 7 15.76 7m40.12 10.22q3.35 0 3.35 2.47 0 1.16-.88 1.77t-2.52.62h-3.18v-4.86Zm-40 0q3.35 0 3.35 2.47 0 1.16-.88 1.77t-2.52.62h-3.18v-4.86Zm39.53-7.3q2.91 0 2.92 2.14 0 1.1-.75 1.72-.75.63-2.17.62h-2.76V9.92Zm-40 0q2.91 0 2.92 2.14 0 1.1-.75 1.72-.75.63-2.17.62h-2.76V9.92Z"></path></svg></div></div></div><noscript><div class="ssrcss-7t07h9-ErrorMessage eitf6465"><div class="ssrcss-h7lv7m-StyledInnerContainer eitf6464"><div class="ssrcss-nbxsk2-TextContent eitf6461"><h2 type="normal" class="ssrcss-3nbqz0-Heading e10rt3ze0">To play this video you need to enable JavaScript in your browser.</h2><p class="ssrcss-1q0x1qg-Paragraph e1jhz7w10">This video can not be played</p></div></div></div></noscript></div></div></figure></div></div></div><div data-block="text" class="ssrcss-vxwoax-ComponentWrapper e1aon0op1"><div class="ssrcss-126h8e-Spacer e1aon0op0"><div data-testid="rich-text"><div class="ssrcss-nqezkk-RichTextContainer e5tfeyi1"><p class="ssrcss-1q0x1qg-Paragraph e1jhz7w10"><b class="ssrcss-1xjjfut-BoldText e5tfeyi3">Try it together</b></p><p class="ssrcss-1q0x1qg-Paragraph e1jhz7w10">Watching a show your child loves, telling jokes or taking turns to pull funny faces at each other can be a great way to relax and handle nervousness.</p><p class="ssrcss-1q0x1qg-Paragraph e1jhz7w10"><b class="ssrcss-1xjjfut-BoldText e5tfeyi3">How it works</b></p><p class="ssrcss-1q0x1qg-Paragraph e1jhz7w10">Laughter or feeling stimulated helps decrease stress hormones, and relaxes muscles.</p></div></div></div></div><div data-block="subheadline" class="ssrcss-vxwoax-ComponentWrapper e1aon0op1"><div class="ssrcss-usmnse-Spacer e1aon0op0"><div data-testid="subheadline"><h2 id="breathing-visualiser" tabindex="-1" class="ssrcss-1x50o22-Heading e10rt3ze0"><span role="text">3. Breathe deep…</span></h2></div></div></div><div data-block="media" class="ssrcss-l7emlr-ComponentWrapper e1aon0op1"><div class="ssrcss-126h8e-Spacer e1aon0op0"><div class="ssrcss-1uy5kw5-FullWidthWrapper ep2nwvo1"><figure class="ssrcss-zv4k6i-StyledFigure e34k3c22"><div class="ssrcss-ab5fd8-StyledFigureContainer e34k3c21"><div data-chromatic="ignore" class="ssrcss-dtyrnv-MediaPlayerWrapper e1h75hkw2"><div data-testid="media-player-container-landscape" class="ssrcss-78d3mz-MediaContainer e1h75hkw1"><div class="ssrcss-199fzb3-MediaInner e1h75hkw0"><div data-testid="bbc-logo-wrapper" class="ssrcss-1tlcek-LogoIconWrapper eaj4kwa0"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 112 32" class="ssrcss-xi5oyi-StyledIcon e161cein1" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M112 0v32H80V0zM72 0v32H40V0zM32 0v32H0V0zm65.47 6.8q-2.16 0-3.9.65a8 8 0 0 0-4.9 4.75 10 10 0 0 0-.65 3.79q0 2.15.63 3.86a8 8 0 0 0 1.83 2.9q1.2 1.19 2.92 1.81 1.73.63 3.9.63 1.61 0 3.1-.36 1.46-.35 2.58-.97v-3.43a9.6 9.6 0 0 1-5.15 1.46 6.5 6.5 0 0 1-3.12-.7 4.6 4.6 0 0 1-1.95-2 7 7 0 0 1-.68-3.2q0-1.87.7-3.19a4.7 4.7 0 0 1 2-2 7 7 0 0 1 3.17-.69q1.35 0 2.57.36a8 8 0 0 1 2.26 1.05v-3.5q-1.14-.6-2.48-.9-1.33-.3-2.83-.31M55.76 7H49v18h7.17a10 10 0 0 0 3.65-.63 4.7 4.7 0 0 0 3.16-4.56q0-1.63-.85-2.78a5 5 0 0 0-2.43-1.67 4 4 0 0 0 1.73-1.5q.6-.94.6-2.23a4 4 0 0 0-1.65-3.43Q58.74 7 55.76 7m-40 0H9v18h7.17a10 10 0 0 0 3.65-.63 4.7 4.7 0 0 0 3.16-4.56q0-1.63-.85-2.78a5 5 0 0 0-2.43-1.67 4 4 0 0 0 1.73-1.5q.6-.94.6-2.23a4 4 0 0 0-1.65-3.43Q18.74 7 15.76 7m40.12 10.22q3.35 0 3.35 2.47 0 1.16-.88 1.77t-2.52.62h-3.18v-4.86Zm-40 0q3.35 0 3.35 2.47 0 1.16-.88 1.77t-2.52.62h-3.18v-4.86Zm39.53-7.3q2.91 0 2.92 2.14 0 1.1-.75 1.72-.75.63-2.17.62h-2.76V9.92Zm-40 0q2.91 0 2.92 2.14 0 1.1-.75 1.72-.75.63-2.17.62h-2.76V9.92Z"></path></svg></div></div></div><noscript><div class="ssrcss-7t07h9-ErrorMessage eitf6465"><div class="ssrcss-h7lv7m-StyledInnerContainer eitf6464"><div class="ssrcss-nbxsk2-TextContent eitf6461"><h2 type="normal" class="ssrcss-3nbqz0-Heading e10rt3ze0">To play this video you need to enable JavaScript in your browser.</h2><p class="ssrcss-1q0x1qg-Paragraph e1jhz7w10">This video can not be played</p></div></div></div></noscript></div></div></figure></div></div></div><div data-block="text" class="ssrcss-vxwoax-ComponentWrapper e1aon0op1"><div class="ssrcss-126h8e-Spacer e1aon0op0"><div data-testid="rich-text"><div class="ssrcss-nqezkk-RichTextContainer e5tfeyi1"><p class="ssrcss-1q0x1qg-Paragraph e1jhz7w10"><b class="ssrcss-1xjjfut-BoldText e5tfeyi3">Try it together</b></p><p class="ssrcss-1q0x1qg-Paragraph e1jhz7w10">Encourage your child to breathe in, hold and breathe out. You could use our visualiser as a guide - find a rate that feels comfortable for your little one. Keep going until they feel calmer.</p><p class="ssrcss-1q0x1qg-Paragraph e1jhz7w10"><b class="ssrcss-1xjjfut-BoldText e5tfeyi3">How it works</b></p><p class="ssrcss-1q0x1qg-Paragraph e1jhz7w10">Simply taking a series of deep breaths will slow down your little one’s heart rate, and help them feel more in control. </p></div></div></div></div><div data-block="subheadline" class="ssrcss-vxwoax-ComponentWrapper e1aon0op1"><div class="ssrcss-usmnse-Spacer e1aon0op0"><div data-testid="subheadline"><h2 id="4-Stretch-it-out" tabindex="-1" class="ssrcss-1x50o22-Heading e10rt3ze0"><span role="text">4. Stretch it out…</span></h2></div></div></div><div data-block="media" class="ssrcss-l7emlr-ComponentWrapper e1aon0op1"><div class="ssrcss-126h8e-Spacer e1aon0op0"><div class="ssrcss-1uy5kw5-FullWidthWrapper ep2nwvo1"><figure class="ssrcss-zv4k6i-StyledFigure e34k3c22"><div class="ssrcss-ab5fd8-StyledFigureContainer e34k3c21"><div data-chromatic="ignore" class="ssrcss-dtyrnv-MediaPlayerWrapper e1h75hkw2"><div data-testid="media-player-container-landscape" class="ssrcss-78d3mz-MediaContainer e1h75hkw1"><div class="ssrcss-199fzb3-MediaInner e1h75hkw0"><div data-testid="bbc-logo-wrapper" class="ssrcss-1tlcek-LogoIconWrapper eaj4kwa0"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 112 32" class="ssrcss-xi5oyi-StyledIcon e161cein1" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M112 0v32H80V0zM72 0v32H40V0zM32 0v32H0V0zm65.47 6.8q-2.16 0-3.9.65a8 8 0 0 0-4.9 4.75 10 10 0 0 0-.65 3.79q0 2.15.63 3.86a8 8 0 0 0 1.83 2.9q1.2 1.19 2.92 1.81 1.73.63 3.9.63 1.61 0 3.1-.36 1.46-.35 2.58-.97v-3.43a9.6 9.6 0 0 1-5.15 1.46 6.5 6.5 0 0 1-3.12-.7 4.6 4.6 0 0 1-1.95-2 7 7 0 0 1-.68-3.2q0-1.87.7-3.19a4.7 4.7 0 0 1 2-2 7 7 0 0 1 3.17-.69q1.35 0 2.57.36a8 8 0 0 1 2.26 1.05v-3.5q-1.14-.6-2.48-.9-1.33-.3-2.83-.31M55.76 7H49v18h7.17a10 10 0 0 0 3.65-.63 4.7 4.7 0 0 0 3.16-4.56q0-1.63-.85-2.78a5 5 0 0 0-2.43-1.67 4 4 0 0 0 1.73-1.5q.6-.94.6-2.23a4 4 0 0 0-1.65-3.43Q58.74 7 55.76 7m-40 0H9v18h7.17a10 10 0 0 0 3.65-.63 4.7 4.7 0 0 0 3.16-4.56q0-1.63-.85-2.78a5 5 0 0 0-2.43-1.67 4 4 0 0 0 1.73-1.5q.6-.94.6-2.23a4 4 0 0 0-1.65-3.43Q18.74 7 15.76 7m40.12 10.22q3.35 0 3.35 2.47 0 1.16-.88 1.77t-2.52.62h-3.18v-4.86Zm-40 0q3.35 0 3.35 2.47 0 1.16-.88 1.77t-2.52.62h-3.18v-4.86Zm39.53-7.3q2.91 0 2.92 2.14 0 1.1-.75 1.72-.75.63-2.17.62h-2.76V9.92Zm-40 0q2.91 0 2.92 2.14 0 1.1-.75 1.72-.75.63-2.17.62h-2.76V9.92Z"></path></svg></div></div></div><noscript><div class="ssrcss-7t07h9-ErrorMessage eitf6465"><div class="ssrcss-h7lv7m-StyledInnerContainer eitf6464"><div class="ssrcss-nbxsk2-TextContent eitf6461"><h2 type="normal" class="ssrcss-3nbqz0-Heading e10rt3ze0">To play this video you need to enable JavaScript in your browser.</h2><p class="ssrcss-1q0x1qg-Paragraph e1jhz7w10">This video can not be played</p></div></div></div></noscript></div></div></figure></div></div></div><div data-block="text" class="ssrcss-vxwoax-ComponentWrapper e1aon0op1"><div class="ssrcss-126h8e-Spacer e1aon0op0"><div data-testid="rich-text"><div class="ssrcss-nqezkk-RichTextContainer e5tfeyi1"><p class="ssrcss-1q0x1qg-Paragraph e1jhz7w10"><b class="ssrcss-1xjjfut-BoldText e5tfeyi3">Try it together</b></p><p class="ssrcss-1q0x1qg-Paragraph e1jhz7w10">Stretch your arms above your heads, stand on tiptoes and make yourselves as tall as possible then flop back down, just like this.</p><p class="ssrcss-1q0x1qg-Paragraph e1jhz7w10"><b class="ssrcss-1xjjfut-BoldText e5tfeyi3">How it works</b></p><p class="ssrcss-1q0x1qg-Paragraph e1jhz7w10">Encourage your little one to stretch out their muscles to reduce tension. Demonstrate how they could stretch out like a cat, or reach up to the sky.</p></div></div></div></div><div data-block="subheadline" class="ssrcss-vxwoax-ComponentWrapper e1aon0op1"><div class="ssrcss-usmnse-Spacer e1aon0op0"><div data-testid="subheadline"><h2 id="5-Go-cloudspotting" tabindex="-1" class="ssrcss-1x50o22-Heading e10rt3ze0"><span role="text">5. Go cloud-spotting…</span></h2></div></div></div><div data-block="media" class="ssrcss-l7emlr-ComponentWrapper e1aon0op1"><div class="ssrcss-126h8e-Spacer e1aon0op0"><div class="ssrcss-1uy5kw5-FullWidthWrapper ep2nwvo1"><figure class="ssrcss-zv4k6i-StyledFigure e34k3c22"><div class="ssrcss-ab5fd8-StyledFigureContainer e34k3c21"><div data-chromatic="ignore" class="ssrcss-dtyrnv-MediaPlayerWrapper e1h75hkw2"><div data-testid="media-player-container-landscape" class="ssrcss-78d3mz-MediaContainer e1h75hkw1"><div class="ssrcss-199fzb3-MediaInner e1h75hkw0"><div data-testid="bbc-logo-wrapper" class="ssrcss-1tlcek-LogoIconWrapper eaj4kwa0"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 112 32" class="ssrcss-xi5oyi-StyledIcon e161cein1" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M112 0v32H80V0zM72 0v32H40V0zM32 0v32H0V0zm65.47 6.8q-2.16 0-3.9.65a8 8 0 0 0-4.9 4.75 10 10 0 0 0-.65 3.79q0 2.15.63 3.86a8 8 0 0 0 1.83 2.9q1.2 1.19 2.92 1.81 1.73.63 3.9.63 1.61 0 3.1-.36 1.46-.35 2.58-.97v-3.43a9.6 9.6 0 0 1-5.15 1.46 6.5 6.5 0 0 1-3.12-.7 4.6 4.6 0 0 1-1.95-2 7 7 0 0 1-.68-3.2q0-1.87.7-3.19a4.7 4.7 0 0 1 2-2 7 7 0 0 1 3.17-.69q1.35 0 2.57.36a8 8 0 0 1 2.26 1.05v-3.5q-1.14-.6-2.48-.9-1.33-.3-2.83-.31M55.76 7H49v18h7.17a10 10 0 0 0 3.65-.63 4.7 4.7 0 0 0 3.16-4.56q0-1.63-.85-2.78a5 5 0 0 0-2.43-1.67 4 4 0 0 0 1.73-1.5q.6-.94.6-2.23a4 4 0 0 0-1.65-3.43Q58.74 7 55.76 7m-40 0H9v18h7.17a10 10 0 0 0 3.65-.63 4.7 4.7 0 0 0 3.16-4.56q0-1.63-.85-2.78a5 5 0 0 0-2.43-1.67 4 4 0 0 0 1.73-1.5q.6-.94.6-2.23a4 4 0 0 0-1.65-3.43Q18.74 7 15.76 7m40.12 10.22q3.35 0 3.35 2.47 0 1.16-.88 1.77t-2.52.62h-3.18v-4.86Zm-40 0q3.35 0 3.35 2.47 0 1.16-.88 1.77t-2.52.62h-3.18v-4.86Zm39.53-7.3q2.91 0 2.92 2.14 0 1.1-.75 1.72-.75.63-2.17.62h-2.76V9.92Zm-40 0q2.91 0 2.92 2.14 0 1.1-.75 1.72-.75.63-2.17.62h-2.76V9.92Z"></path></svg></div></div></div><noscript><div class="ssrcss-7t07h9-ErrorMessage eitf6465"><div class="ssrcss-h7lv7m-StyledInnerContainer eitf6464"><div class="ssrcss-nbxsk2-TextContent eitf6461"><h2 type="normal" class="ssrcss-3nbqz0-Heading e10rt3ze0">To play this video you need to enable JavaScript in your browser.</h2><p class="ssrcss-1q0x1qg-Paragraph e1jhz7w10">This video can not be played</p></div></div></div></noscript></div></div></figure></div></div></div><div data-block="text" class="ssrcss-vxwoax-ComponentWrapper e1aon0op1"><div class="ssrcss-126h8e-Spacer e1aon0op0"><div data-testid="rich-text"><div class="ssrcss-nqezkk-RichTextContainer e5tfeyi1"><p class="ssrcss-1q0x1qg-Paragraph e1jhz7w10"><b class="ssrcss-1xjjfut-BoldText e5tfeyi3">Try it together</b></p><p class="ssrcss-1q0x1qg-Paragraph e1jhz7w10">Stay as still as you can and simply watch the clouds go by together. See if your little one can spot any shapes among the clouds. Use our visualiser if it&#x27;s not practical to go outdoors - keep watching closely and you might even spot some familiar CBeebies characters.</p><p class="ssrcss-1q0x1qg-Paragraph e1jhz7w10"><b class="ssrcss-1xjjfut-BoldText e5tfeyi3">How it works</b></p><p class="ssrcss-1q0x1qg-Paragraph e1jhz7w10">This common technique encourages your child to relax and take their mind off other things. You could do this alongside deep breathing to really help your child chill out.</p></div></div></div></div><div data-block="subheadline" class="ssrcss-vxwoax-ComponentWrapper e1aon0op1"><div class="ssrcss-usmnse-Spacer e1aon0op0"><div data-testid="subheadline"><h2 id="6-Relax-with-CBeebies-Radio" tabindex="-1" class="ssrcss-1x50o22-Heading e10rt3ze0"><span role="text">6. Relax with CBeebies Radio</span></h2></div></div></div><div data-block="image" class="ssrcss-l7emlr-ComponentWrapper e1aon0op1"><div class="ssrcss-126h8e-Spacer e1aon0op0"><div data-testid="image" class="ssrcss-1uy5kw5-FullWidthWrapper ep2nwvo1"><figure class="ssrcss-zv4k6i-StyledFigure e34k3c22"><div class="ssrcss-ab5fd8-StyledFigureContainer e34k3c21"><span class="ssrcss-1pflr6j-Placeholder etlorgc0"><picture><source srcSet="https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/240/childrens/childrens-binarystore/cbeebies/cbeebiesradio_calmingsoundsarticle_index_1920_1080.jpg.webp 240w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/320/childrens/childrens-binarystore/cbeebies/cbeebiesradio_calmingsoundsarticle_index_1920_1080.jpg.webp 320w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/480/childrens/childrens-binarystore/cbeebies/cbeebiesradio_calmingsoundsarticle_index_1920_1080.jpg.webp 480w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/624/childrens/childrens-binarystore/cbeebies/cbeebiesradio_calmingsoundsarticle_index_1920_1080.jpg.webp 624w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/800/childrens/childrens-binarystore/cbeebies/cbeebiesradio_calmingsoundsarticle_index_1920_1080.jpg.webp 800w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/976/childrens/childrens-binarystore/cbeebies/cbeebiesradio_calmingsoundsarticle_index_1920_1080.jpg.webp 976w" type="image/webp"/><img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/976/childrens/childrens-binarystore/cbeebies/cbeebiesradio_calmingsoundsarticle_index_1920_1080.jpg" srcSet="https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/240/childrens/childrens-binarystore/cbeebies/cbeebiesradio_calmingsoundsarticle_index_1920_1080.jpg 240w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/320/childrens/childrens-binarystore/cbeebies/cbeebiesradio_calmingsoundsarticle_index_1920_1080.jpg 320w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/480/childrens/childrens-binarystore/cbeebies/cbeebiesradio_calmingsoundsarticle_index_1920_1080.jpg 480w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/624/childrens/childrens-binarystore/cbeebies/cbeebiesradio_calmingsoundsarticle_index_1920_1080.jpg 624w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/800/childrens/childrens-binarystore/cbeebies/cbeebiesradio_calmingsoundsarticle_index_1920_1080.jpg 800w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/976/childrens/childrens-binarystore/cbeebies/cbeebiesradio_calmingsoundsarticle_index_1920_1080.jpg 976w" width="976" height="549" class="ssrcss-egie1y-Image edrdn950"/></picture></span></div></figure></div></div></div><div data-block="text" class="ssrcss-vxwoax-ComponentWrapper e1aon0op1"><div class="ssrcss-126h8e-Spacer e1aon0op0"><div data-testid="rich-text"><div class="ssrcss-nqezkk-RichTextContainer e5tfeyi1"><p class="ssrcss-1q0x1qg-Paragraph e1jhz7w10"><b class="ssrcss-1xjjfut-BoldText e5tfeyi3">Try it together</b></p><p class="ssrcss-1q0x1qg-Paragraph e1jhz7w10">Relax and listen to the <a href="/cbeebies/curations/radio-calming-sounds" class="ssrcss-1rxnd1h-InlineLink e1kn3p7n0">calming sounds from CBeebies Radio.</a></p><p class="ssrcss-1q0x1qg-Paragraph e1jhz7w10"><b class="ssrcss-1xjjfut-BoldText e5tfeyi3">How it works</b></p><p class="ssrcss-1q0x1qg-Paragraph e1jhz7w10">Listening to relaxing music can help children stop and reset. CBeebies Radio have eight calming sounds to choose from which allows you to experiment and find which one works best:</p><p class="ssrcss-1q0x1qg-Paragraph e1jhz7w10"><b class="ssrcss-1xjjfut-BoldText e5tfeyi3">Waves, birdsong, rain, car journey, spaceship, white noise, pink noise and brown noise.</b></p><p class="ssrcss-1q0x1qg-Paragraph e1jhz7w10">Claire Benton, Head of Audiology, Nottingham, says:</p><p class="ssrcss-1q0x1qg-Paragraph e1jhz7w10">“Many children find these sounds relaxing and listening to them can help a child feel calm enough to fall asleep&quot;.</p></div></div></div></div><div data-block="subheadline" class="ssrcss-vxwoax-ComponentWrapper e1aon0op1"><div class="ssrcss-usmnse-Spacer e1aon0op0"><div data-testid="subheadline"><h2 id="7-Do-a-doodle-or-colour-in" tabindex="-1" class="ssrcss-1x50o22-Heading e10rt3ze0"><span role="text">7. Do a doodle or colour in…</span></h2></div></div></div><div data-block="image" class="ssrcss-l7emlr-ComponentWrapper e1aon0op1"><div class="ssrcss-126h8e-Spacer e1aon0op0"><div data-testid="image" class="ssrcss-1uy5kw5-FullWidthWrapper ep2nwvo1"><figure class="ssrcss-zv4k6i-StyledFigure e34k3c22"><div class="ssrcss-ab5fd8-StyledFigureContainer e34k3c21"><span class="ssrcss-1pflr6j-Placeholder etlorgc0"><picture><source srcSet="https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/240/childrens/childrens-binarystore/cbeebies/cbeebies-creative-lab-index-image.jpg.webp 240w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/320/childrens/childrens-binarystore/cbeebies/cbeebies-creative-lab-index-image.jpg.webp 320w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/480/childrens/childrens-binarystore/cbeebies/cbeebies-creative-lab-index-image.jpg.webp 480w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/624/childrens/childrens-binarystore/cbeebies/cbeebies-creative-lab-index-image.jpg.webp 624w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/800/childrens/childrens-binarystore/cbeebies/cbeebies-creative-lab-index-image.jpg.webp 800w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/976/childrens/childrens-binarystore/cbeebies/cbeebies-creative-lab-index-image.jpg.webp 976w" type="image/webp"/><img alt="A dark purple background with a blue banner at the bottom. In the middle is a logo that reads &quot;CBeebies Creative Lab&quot; made from rainbow tape, dripping goo and glitter letters. Surrounding the logo are paint splats, rainbows and bubbles." loading="lazy" src="https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/976/childrens/childrens-binarystore/cbeebies/cbeebies-creative-lab-index-image.jpg" srcSet="https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/240/childrens/childrens-binarystore/cbeebies/cbeebies-creative-lab-index-image.jpg 240w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/320/childrens/childrens-binarystore/cbeebies/cbeebies-creative-lab-index-image.jpg 320w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/480/childrens/childrens-binarystore/cbeebies/cbeebies-creative-lab-index-image.jpg 480w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/624/childrens/childrens-binarystore/cbeebies/cbeebies-creative-lab-index-image.jpg 624w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/800/childrens/childrens-binarystore/cbeebies/cbeebies-creative-lab-index-image.jpg 800w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/976/childrens/childrens-binarystore/cbeebies/cbeebies-creative-lab-index-image.jpg 976w" width="976" height="549" class="ssrcss-egie1y-Image edrdn950"/></picture></span></div></figure></div></div></div><div data-block="text" class="ssrcss-vxwoax-ComponentWrapper e1aon0op1"><div class="ssrcss-126h8e-Spacer e1aon0op0"><div data-testid="rich-text"><div class="ssrcss-nqezkk-RichTextContainer e5tfeyi1"><p class="ssrcss-1q0x1qg-Paragraph e1jhz7w10"><b class="ssrcss-1xjjfut-BoldText e5tfeyi3">Try it together</b></p><p class="ssrcss-1q0x1qg-Paragraph e1jhz7w10">Get busy with paper and crayons, or use <a href="/cbeebies/games/cbeebies-creative-lab" class="ssrcss-1rxnd1h-InlineLink e1kn3p7n0">CBeebies Creative Lab</a> and doodle to your heart&#x27;s content.</p><p class="ssrcss-1q0x1qg-Paragraph e1jhz7w10"><b class="ssrcss-1xjjfut-BoldText e5tfeyi3">How it works</b></p><p class="ssrcss-1q0x1qg-Paragraph e1jhz7w10">Doodling can help relieve stress by giving your brain a rest, and it can also spark creativity. Pablo uses his doodles and subsequent trips to the Art World to solve the real-world issues thrown up by his autism.</p></div></div></div></div><div data-block="subheadline" class="ssrcss-vxwoax-ComponentWrapper e1aon0op1"><div class="ssrcss-usmnse-Spacer e1aon0op0"><div data-testid="subheadline"><h2 id="Health-and-wellbeing" tabindex="-1" class="ssrcss-1x50o22-Heading e10rt3ze0"><span role="text">Health and wellbeing</span></h2></div></div></div><div data-block="text" class="ssrcss-vxwoax-ComponentWrapper e1aon0op1"><div class="ssrcss-126h8e-Spacer e1aon0op0"><div data-testid="rich-text"><div class="ssrcss-nqezkk-RichTextContainer e5tfeyi1"><p class="ssrcss-1q0x1qg-Paragraph e1jhz7w10">Find <a href="/cbeebies/curations/mindfulness-for-children" class="ssrcss-1rxnd1h-InlineLink e1kn3p7n0">helpful tips and tricks to help children relax and be mindful</a> of the world around them and helpful advice for parents and careers.</p></div></div></div></div><div data-block="subheadline" class="ssrcss-vxwoax-ComponentWrapper e1aon0op1"><div class="ssrcss-usmnse-Spacer e1aon0op0"><div data-testid="subheadline"><h2 id="Starting-School-with-CBeebies" tabindex="-1" class="ssrcss-1x50o22-Heading e10rt3ze0"><span role="text">Starting School with CBeebies</span></h2></div></div></div><div data-block="text" class="ssrcss-vxwoax-ComponentWrapper e1aon0op1"><div class="ssrcss-126h8e-Spacer e1aon0op0"><div data-testid="rich-text"><div class="ssrcss-nqezkk-RichTextContainer e5tfeyi1"><p class="ssrcss-1q0x1qg-Paragraph e1jhz7w10">Are you looking for tips on handling primary school, new friends, homework and phonics? <a href="/cbeebies/curations/starting-school-curation" class="ssrcss-1rxnd1h-InlineLink e1kn3p7n0">Find articles, activities, learning tips and much more in the CBeebies starting school collection</a>.</p></div></div></div></div><div data-block="topicList" class="ssrcss-vxwoax-ComponentWrapper e1aon0op1"><div class="ssrcss-tcr9z1-Spacer e1aon0op0"><div data-testid="topic-list"><div class="ssrcss-102dpv6-StyledTagContainer ed0g1kj1"><div class="ssrcss-1pfbb52-TopicListHeaderWrapper etw6iwl0"><h2 type="normal" class="ssrcss-3nbqz0-Heading e10rt3ze0">Related topics</h2></div><div class="ssrcss-17ehax8-Cluster e1ihwmse1"><ul role="list" spacing="2" class="ssrcss-w8zanw-ClusterItems e1ihwmse0"><li><a href="/cbeebies/shows/pablo" class="ssrcss-1qpde7-StyledLink ed0g1kj0">Pablo</a></li></ul></div></div></div></div></div></div></article></main></div><div class="ssrcss-115e9m-StyledZone e1mcntqj3"><aside id="olderKidsGames-label-aside-content" data-testid="olderKidsGames-label-aside-content" aria-labelledby="olderKidsGames-label"><div data-component="olderKidsGames" class="ssrcss-w3fj6k-OnwardJourneysContainerWrapper e1ia0oo99"><h2 id="olderKidsGames-label" type="normal" class="ssrcss-3nbqz0-Heading e10rt3ze0">Games for older kids</h2><div class="ssrcss-lr31nz-PromoGroupWrapper e1ia0oo98"><ul role="list" spacing="responsive" class="ssrcss-jfsm4z-Stack e1y4nx260"><li class="ssrcss-d44z91-PromoItem e1ia0oo97"><div data-testid="promo" class="ssrcss-1uqdwtw-Promo e1vyq2e80"><div class="ssrcss-1ugqpo7-PromoPortrait et3mn3r0"><div class=